    "Lighter dumbbells."
   ],
   "progressions": [
    "Slower lowering."
   ]
  },
  "muscleNotes": {
   "pec": "As in the fly the pectoralis works hardest with the arms open; turning the hands at the top is a coaching variation (clinical opinion)."
